        Web API + PowerShell. PAC CLI does NOT create columns. `attributeType=String` (max 255, `isSearchable=true`) for indexed text; `attributeType=Memo` for JSON provenance; `attributeType=Lookup` (target `sprk_servicerequest`) for the regarding lookup.
      </pattern>
      <pattern name="Data-model documentation" location="docs/data-model/">
        Each entity markdown documents columns: logical name, display name, type, max length / target entity, purpose, consumers. Update on every schema change.
